    <innerclass refid="classterminal_1_1_dialog" prot="public">terminal::Dialog</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespaceterminal">terminal</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Generic two-choice modal confirmation dialog. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_dialog" kindref="compound">terminal::Dialog</ref> is a juce::Component intended to be hosted inside <ref refid="classterminal_1_1_popup" kindref="compound">terminal::Popup</ref>. It renders a message label and two <ref refid="classTextButton" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">TextButton</ref> controls (&quot;Yes&quot; / &quot;No&quot;) and exposes callbacks for each choice plus Esc dismissal.</para>
<sect1 id="_dialog_8h_1autotoc_md21_1s1"><sect2 id="_dialog_8h_1autotoc_md21_1s2"><sect3 id="_dialog_8h_1autotoc_md21">
<title>Font tagging</title><para>All labels and buttons are tagged with <computeroutput><ref refid="structjam_1_1_i_d_1a2f2ee05e76603e24f721a5ad93fe4795" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">jam::ID::name</ref></computeroutput> so <ref refid="classterminal_1_1_look_and_feel_1aa684176bbeb98a9854981e2f9e5960e0" kindref="member">terminal::LookAndFeel::getLabelFont</ref> / getTextButtonFont dispatches the action-list name font without hardcoding a family here.</para>
</sect3></sect2></sect1>
<sect1 id="_dialog_8h_1autotoc_md22_1s1"><sect2 id="_dialog_8h_1autotoc_md22_1s2"><sect3 id="_dialog_8h_1autotoc_md22">
<title>Keyboard</title><para>Y / y fires <computeroutput>onYes</computeroutput>. N / n fires <computeroutput>onNo</computeroutput>. Escape is NOT handled here — it propagates to ModalWindow which calls exitModalState(0), which in turn fires <ref refid="classterminal_1_1_popup" kindref="compound">terminal::Popup</ref>&apos;s <computeroutput>onDismiss</computeroutput>.</para>
</sect3></sect2></sect1>
<sect1 id="_dialog_8h_1autotoc_md23_1s1"><sect2 id="_dialog_8h_1autotoc_md23_1s2"><sect3 id="_dialog_8h_1autotoc_md23">
<title>Sizing</title><para>Call getPreferredWidth() / getPreferredHeight() before Popup::show(). Dimensions are derived from content: message text width measured with the action-list name font, button widths sized to fit &quot;Yes&quot; / &quot;No&quot; plus padding, and height computed from line height plus vertical padding.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>All methods are called on the MESSAGE THREAD.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_popup" kindref="compound">terminal::Popup</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_look_and_feel" kindref="compound">terminal::LookAndFeel</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
</sect3></sect2></sect1>
